# Optional: Antigravity OAuth client credentials used by quota polling & warmup.
# You can supply either a JSON array in ARCHPI_AGY_OAUTH_CLIENTS, a single pair below,
# or place the JSON in ~/.archpi/oauth-clients.json outside this repository.

# ARCHPI_AGY_OAUTH_CLIENTS=[{"key":"default","clientId":"your-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com","clientSecret":"your-client-secret"}]
# ARCHPI_AGY_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
# ARCHPI_AGY_CLIENT_SECRET=your-client-secret
